      "value": "You can't really fully protect avatar, as after all everyone in room needs to download it to be able to display it.\nIPs are like in every p2p game accessible to everyone, vrchat would need to proxy all movement, and that means much larger ping and much larger costs.\nIf HWID is leaked too, then devs failed a lot.\n\nAnd while it might feel bad for your avatar to be leaked there is really low chance that someone will actually use it ;)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
